flowchart LR
  Src[Source repo]
  Src --> Vite[Vite build -> dist/]
  Src --> PyI[PyInstaller/Nuitka -> dist/worker/]
  Src --> Tauri[cargo tauri build]
  Vite --> Tauri
  PyI --> Tauri
  Tauri --> Bundles{Per-OS bundle}
  Bundles --> Win[.msi + .exe]
  Bundles --> Mac[.dmg]
  Bundles --> Lin[.AppImage + .deb]
  Win --> SignW[Authenticode sign]
  Mac --> SignM[Developer ID sign + notarytool]
  Lin --> SignL[GPG detached sig]
  SignW --> SBOM[CycloneDX SBOM + Cosign]
  SignM --> SBOM
  SignL --> SBOM
  SBOM --> Feed[Publish to updates feed]
